{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In our free version, you can play up to shop level 10, unlock a set of sushi, access one shop area, and expand your sushi shop\u2019s conveyor belt. This gives you a taste of the core gameplay experience and a glimpse of what\u2019s waiting for you in the full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Conveyor Belt Sushi Simulator&quot; is a cozy first-person simulation where you serve sushi to customers, earn money, and grow your sushi restaurant business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PROLOGUE FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/Steampage_MakeSushi_English.png?t=1741203612\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/makeSush-optimize.gif?t=1741203612\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sushi and place it on the conveyor belt, allowing customers to pick their favorite sushi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/Steampage_OrderStock_English.png?t=1741203612\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/OrderStock-optimize.gif?t=1741203612\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order stock from the supplier using your tablet. Seafood prices vary daily based on the day's supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/Steampage_CalculateBill_English.png?t=1741203612\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/scan-optimize.gif?t=1741203612\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scan the sushi plates to calculate the bill. Make sure you don\u2019t miss any plates, or you\u2019ll receive less money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/Steampage_ServingCustomers_English.png?t=1741203612\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/extras/handleCustomer-optimize.gif?t=1741203612\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean the table for the next customer and deal with troublesome customers before they cause any trouble.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539020?t=1741203612","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/a1df303310a0b8216b0fb9dd0ea220b84bf8824d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741203612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/685ebb10a9864e50d6984f9a1dc43dab620b186a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741203612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539020/685ebb10a9864e50d6984f9a1dc43dab620b186a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741203612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In our free version, you can play up to shop level 10, unlock a set of sushi, access one shop area, and expand your sushi shop\u2019s conveyor belt. This gives you a taste of the core gameplay experience and a glimpse of what\u2019s waiting for you in the full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Conveyor Belt Sushi Simulator&quot; is a cozy first-person simulation where you serve sushi to customers, earn money, and grow your sushi restaurant business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"